    "28": {
      "date": "2026-11-24",
      "edition": "Tuesday 24 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Rematch build-up",
          "heading": "Italy's Leonardo Marin admits ill-discipline handed Fiji Udine win, vows Twickenham fix",
          "body": "Fiji's 21-16 win in Udine was, by Leonardo Marin's account, a big chance Italy threw away. The Benetton centre said the Azzurri created plenty but squandered good try-scoring opportunities through errors, then conceded too many needless penalties that Fiji turned into a second-half gap. For the Twickenham rematch for 11th place, he wants Italy to hold the ball through more phases and gift nothing, warning the short turnaround makes physical preparation hard. Italy have called up Andrea Zambonin and Louis Lynagh."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Ireland captain Dan Sheehan's yellow upgraded to red card",
          "body": "Wallabies beat Wales 29-26, ending losing run. South Africa make seven changes, starting Libbok and Reinach for final. All Blacks lose Luke Jacobson to Bayonne."
        }
      ],
      "match": {
