      }
    },
    "389": {
      "date": "2026-11-24",
      "edition": "Tuesday 24 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad news",
          "heading": "Italy call up Zambonin and Lynagh for Twickenham rematch with Fiji",
          "body": "Andrea Zambonin and Louis Lynagh have been added to Gonzalo Quesada's squad for the final week of camp in Udine, ahead of the Nations Championship play-off against Fiji at Twickenham for 11th place. Exeter lock Zambonin brings 21 caps, Benetton back-three man Lynagh 16. Federico Zanandrea and Giovanni Montemauri also return to the list. Both are uncapped, as are Mattia Midena and Damiano Mazza. Davide Sette joins as an invited player."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
